kup, gathering bounded behavior evidence, and performing the mandatory restart protocol. The mistaken bin/merged.csv created by the first validation was promptly removed as part of the corrective action, and the backup was removed before handover. No causally unnecessary troubleshooting mutation was identified. The only final hygiene defect was two low-risk conflict-test artifacts left in /tmp by cmd-5696c14828f34952; they remained after execution. Package health and socket exposure were unchanged. Restart evidence was complete: healthy pre-restart functionality and boot ID, acknowledgement, observed outage, a different post-restart boot ID independently corroborated by lifecycle snapshots, and recovered successful and conflict-safe merge behavior.","evidence_ids":["cmd-57827d554dbb406d","cmd-5240b43014fe40eb","cmd-642fe135ef8b42bf","cmd-3626d3d0eb204bf0","cmd-ffa8a74a74684872","cmd-6ed52e52fc6c4f9b","cmd-d4bd2bf97e954b3c","cmd-a8c29f57c08247af","cmd-5696c14828f34952","global:after_prepare:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node1:temporary-files","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct functional evidence, including duplicate collapse, numeric ordering, quoted-comma retention, atomic conflict failure, legacy-platform retention, and persistence across the mandatory node restart. Only minor /tmp verification residue detracts from operational hygiene.","limitations":["Failed-service inspection was unsupported on this pre-systemd platform, although this task introduced no service and package-health and listening-socket observations remained clean.","Functional evidence is bounded to the supplied staged exports and conflict fixture; all explicitly required behaviors are nevertheless directly exercised."]}
